0f4a93c8e175"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "In this notebook, we give an explicit 4-coloring of some state of the \
Birkhoff diamond for each of the colored caps.  In the file \
ProofCode2-ColoredCapsOnReducer.nb, we generate an output file which contains \
a list of every possible colored cap that is compatible with a coloring on \
some state of our reducer -- see reducer immediately below.\n",
