 "\n\nThe colored cap is shown below on the left (using only 3 colors red, \
blue, green).  Notice that this cap can be used to 3-face color the reducer \
above (try it!). A corresponding 4-face coloring of the Birkhoff diamond is \
then shown on the right. Notice that to obtain this coloring we needed to \
change arc[1,A[1,12]] from red to yellow (i.e. arc[4,A[1,12]]).  \n",
