Cell["\<\
The next command display the full version of Table 1 from the paper  with a \
valid 4-face coloring of a capped state of the Birkhoff diamond (column 4) \
for each colored cap of the reducer (column 3).  The command will run \
quickly, but with suppressed output .  Clicking show all will display the \
full table, but takes several seconds to run.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.944046994705755*^9, 
  3.944047073320834*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"532c3dfc-e153-42db-8367-\
4b136f967804"],

